{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "bram_intro_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "emberwood",
      "tone": "academic",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "He's taking notes while being mugged.",
        "\"The ink-stained coat confuses them. They think scholars are easy marks.\" A quiet satisfaction. \"They're not wrong about most scholars.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "help",
          "text": "Help him with the muggers.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "start_combat", "enemyGroup": ["bandit", "bandit"] }, { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "companion_vael_met" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "watch",
          "text": "Watch to see how he handles it.",
          "next": "#bram_handles",
          "effects": [{ "type": "set_flag", "flag": "companion_vael_met" }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_handles": {
          "lines": ["He speaks three words in a dead language and they run. He adjusts his spectacles. \"Shadow-mime. Third-year arcana. I appreciate the audience.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "ask_join", "text": "Ask if he wants to join you.", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_notes_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "old_road",
      "tone": "academic",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "He's writing while walking.",
        "\"Notes on the Veil's interaction with the soil here. The topsoil darkens before the deeper layers do — interesting directional spread pattern.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "engage",
          "text": "[Arcana - INT] Engage with the observation.",
          "skillCheck": { "skill": "arcana", "stat": "INT", "dc": 11 },
          "onPass": { "next": "#bram_engaged", "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }] },
          "onFail": { "next": "#bram_gentle", "effects": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Let him work.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 1 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_engaged": {
          "lines": ["\"Exactly — the corruption isn't spreading, it's ascending. It's responding to something above it. That changes everything about containment strategy.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Note that.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "lore_unlock", "loreId": "lore_veilscar_spread_001" }] }]
        },
        "bram_gentle": {
          "lines": ["\"No matter. Different kind of mind. Still useful, yours.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "Accept the compliment-adjacent comment.", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_spectacles_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "stoneward",
      "tone": "personal",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "The spectacles are enchanted. The left lens shows veil-energy density.",
        "\"I built them during the third year of the surge. When I could no longer trust what I was seeing with my actual eyes.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_what_you_see",
          "text": "Ask what he sees right now.",
          "next": "#bram_sees",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_trust",
          "text": "Ask what changed about his eyes.",
          "next": "#bram_eye_change",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_sees": {
          "lines": ["\"Low ambient veil-density. Within tolerable range. The high reading is\" — he tilts his head — \"coming from exactly where you'd expect.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"The Rift.\"", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        },
        "bram_eye_change": {
          "lines": ["\"I looked at a veil-surge directly. For scientific purposes.\" His spectacles catch the light. \"I do not recommend it.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"What did you see?\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "lore_unlock", "loreId": "lore_marek_rift_notes_001" }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_dark_secret_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "ash_plains",
      "tone": "confessional",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "requires": { "flag": "bram_betrayal_revealed" },
      "lines": [
        "\"You've heard about the patrol that disappeared.\"",
        "\"I was the academic advisor who assessed the route as low risk. I was... wrong about several key variables.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "blame",
          "text": "\"You got them killed.\"",
          "next": "#bram_blamed",
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": -2 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "nuance",
          "text": "\"The Council gave the order. You gave an assessment.\"",
          "next": "#bram_nuanced",
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "text": "\"What variables did you miss?\"",
          "next": "#bram_variables",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_blamed": {
          "lines": ["\"Yes.\" He doesn't argue. \"In part. The whole part feels too simple, but... yes.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "Leave him with that.", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        },
        "bram_nuanced": {
          "lines": ["\"That is a more accurate description. Thank you.\" A pause. \"It doesn't make me feel proportionally better.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"It wasn't meant to. It was meant to be accurate.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 1 }] }]
        },
        "bram_variables": {
          "lines": ["\"The veil-surge frequency in the sector. The patrol timing relative to the surge window. And\" — a long pause — \"the Council's intentions for the patrol.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"The last one wasn't a variable you could have known.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_spell_moment_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "veilscar",
      "tone": "absorbed",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "He stops in the middle of the road.",
        "\"The veil here is resonating with a node approximately six hundred meters northwest. There's something old underneath it — pre-Sovereign architecture.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "investigate",
          "text": "Go with him to investigate.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }, { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "architect_ruin_found" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "press_on",
          "text": "\"We haven't got time for detours.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": -1 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_shadow_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "library_ruins",
      "tone": "scholarly-reverent",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "He moves through the library ruins with something like grief.",
        "\"I corresponded with the head archivist for twelve years. She died in the burning.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_about_her",
          "text": "Ask about her.",
          "next": "#bram_archivist",
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 1 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "help_recover",
          "text": "Help him recover what's left of her research.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 3 }, { "type": "lore_unlock", "loreId": "lore_library_burned_001" }, { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "library_ruins_searched" }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_archivist": {
          "lines": ["\"She believed the Library was safer than the city. She wasn't wrong, historically. The cult changed the calculus.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "help", "text": "Help recover what's left.", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }, { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "library_ruins_searched" }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_approval_high_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "crossroads",
      "tone": "warm-academic",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "\"For a group assembled under emergency conditions, you demonstrate unexpected coherence.\"",
        "He says it like a published conclusion."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "thanks",
          "text": "\"That might be the nicest thing you've said to us.\"",
          "next": "#bram_considers",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_considers": {
          "lines": ["He thinks about it seriously. \"It may be. I'll try to recalibrate.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Don't on our account.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 1 }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_rift_analysis_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 3,
      "biome": "riftgate",
      "tone": "scientific-awe",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "He's the only one of you who's smiling.",
        "\"The dimensional frequency here is unlike anything recorded. I would like to observe it for approximately seventeen more minutes before we do anything irreversible to it.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "give_him_time",
          "text": "\"Fifteen minutes.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 3 }, { "type": "lore_unlock", "loreId": "lore_rift_not_accident_001" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "press_on",
          "text": "\"No time. Move.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": -2 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_robes_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "emberwood",
      "tone": "absent-minded",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "The robes are stained with twelve different substances.",
        "He names them when you ask: \"Iron-gall ink, veil-residue, soup, another kind of veil-residue, soup again, and—\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "stop",
          "text": "\"I don't need the full list.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 1 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "full_list",
          "text": "Let him finish.",
          "next": "#bram_finishes",
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_finishes": {
          "lines": ["\"—a third kind of veil-residue, more ink, something that may or may not have been sentient, and what I believe is coffee from a country that doesn't technically exist anymore.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Eventful robes.\"", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bram_closure_001",
      "pool": "companion-bram_coldfire",
      "companionId": "bram_coldfire",
      "act": 3,
      "biome": "sovereigns_approach",
      "tone": "resolved",
      "speaker": "bram_coldfire",
      "lines": [
        "\"If we close the Rift, my life's research becomes historical rather than active.\"",
        "A pause. \"I find I don't mind as much as I expected.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_why",
          "text": "\"Why not?\"",
          "next": "#bram_why_not",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "good",
          "text": "\"Good. Let's make it historical.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 2 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "bram_why_not": {
          "lines": ["\"Because historical means it ended. Things that end are comprehensible.\" He adjusts his spectacles. \"I would like the Veil to be comprehensible.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Close enough.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "bram_coldfire", "amount": 1 }] }]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
